        rdf:type                        "vstoi:Instrument" ;
        rdfs:comment                    "A high-fidelity mannequin, also known as a high-fidelity simulator or manikin, is an advanced medical training device engineered to closely replicate human anatomy and physiological responses. These sophisticated simulators are integral to healthcare education, providing a realistic platform for learners to practice and refine their clinical skills in a controlled, risk-free environment." ;
