pmsr:OBJ_instrumentcollection_INS1739483351917145
        rdf:type                        "vstoi:Instrument" ;
        rdfs:comment                    "This natural-sized, graphic model shows the anatomical structures of a male groin with an indirect inguinal hernia, opened in layers. Two diagrammatic illustrations on the base allow for a comparison of direct and indirect hernia. A useful model to help inform patients before undergoing surgical interventions. Mounted on base." ;
