pmsr:OBJ_instrumentcollection_INS1739301009974715
        rdf:type                        "vstoi:Instrument" ;
        rdfs:comment                    "The Artec Leo is a professional handheld 3D scanner that offers a fully wireless and standalone scanning experience. Equipped with an advanced NVIDIA Jetson TX2 processor, a 5.5-inch HD touch panel display, and an integrated battery, it allows users to capture high-quality 3D data without the need for external devices or cables. The scanner provides real-time visualization of the scanned object on its display, enabling users to monitor progress and ensure complete data acquisition. With a scanning speed of up to 80 frames per second and a large field of view, the Artec Leo is suitable for capturing a wide range of objects, from small mechanical parts to large scenes like crime sites or industrial equipment. Its versatility and user-friendly design make it a valuable tool in various industries, including automotive, healthcare, and art preservation." ;
        rdfs:label                      "ARTEC LEO Scanner" ;
        rdfs:subClassOf                 "pmsr:/INS1739300958884615" ;
        hasco:hasDataAcquisition        "http://example.org/dasoc-smoke-1780407534974/DA-SMOKE" ;
        hasco:hasDataAcquisition        <http://example.org/roundtrip/DA-DA-SOC-INSTRUMENT-PMSR.csv> ;
